        "id": 28408,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-04-18T22:28:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think if we were to do that, I would personally would prefer being incontrol of my deck, just so I actaully can visibly see my cards without having to have the deck sitting out and digging through it to have the cards I should have.</p>",
